OL,3,ARescue efforts enter fifth day on
OL,4,ANepal-Tibet border with more than 2,400
OL,5,Amissing after flash flood
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 675 people have died and more
OL,8,Fthan 2,400 people are missing in Nepal,
OL,9,Flocal officials say, after flash floods
OL,10,Fon Wednesday
OL,12,FRescue efforts continue on the
OL,13,FNepal-Tibet border - 320 foreign
OL,14,Fnationals are among the missing,
OL,15,FNepal's tourism board says
OL,17,FIn Tibet, the official death toll is
OL,18,F16, with 546 reported to be missing,
OL,19,Faccording to Chinese state media
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
