OL,3,ARescue efforts enter fifth day on
OL,4,ANepal-Tibet border with more than 2,400
OL,5,Amissing after flash flood
OL,6,
OL,7,FInformation is more tightly controlled
OL,8,Fby the Chinese authorities and it has
OL,9,Fbeen harder to assess the scale of the
OL,10,Fdisaster in Tibet
OL,12,FLevels at a lake formed after the
OL,13,Ffloods - which had prompted safety
OL,14,Fconcerns over fears it could overflow -
OL,15,Fare now receding, Chinese officials say
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
